data/pages/
*.log
__pycache__/

# Agent-harness scratch. Tranche does not read, ship or depend on any of these,
# so a checkout never carries a harness's own config, sessions or vendored skill
# trees. AGENTS.md is deliberately NOT ignored: repository instructions, when a
# contributor adds them, are tracked like any other file.
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.aider*
.opencode/
.gemini/
.specstory/
.copilot/
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.md
skills-lock.json
.work/

# Native evidence runtime state (issue #9). Captured public evidence is local
# runtime data; fixtures and deliberately published output are a different
# category and are tracked on purpose.
out/evidence/

# Model-pass lock files. Same category as evidence runtime state: concurrency
# control for this checkout's own passes, not part of the published report.
out/*.jsonl.lock

# Rust build artifacts; the lockfile is tracked for reproducible CLI builds.
/target/
